     }
    },
    {
     "quote_id": "b_q7",
     "source_id": "b_s4",
     "text": "Gladiator Hulk BAF piece is NOT included.",
     "scope": {
      "kind": "figure",
      "manufacturer": "hasbro",
      "product_line": "marvel-legends",
      "year": null,
      "character_canonical": "hela",
      "character_variant": null,
      "condition": "loose"
     }
    },
    {
     "quote_id": "c_q1",
     "source_id": "c_s1",
     "text": "The arms have rotating hinges in the shoulders, elbows, and wrists. The legs are ball jointed at the hips, with swivels in the thighs, double hinges in the knees, and hinges and lateral rockers in the ankles.",
     "scope": {
      "kind": "figure",
      "manufacturer": "hasbro",
      "product_line": "marvel-legends",
      "year": 2017,
      "character_canonical": "hela",
      "character_variant": null,
      "condition": null
     }
    },
    {
     "quote_id": "c_q2",
     "source_id": "c_s1",
     "text": "The un-helmeted head sculpt is superb. Not only is it a solid likeness to Blanchett for this scale and price range, but there's some wonderful paint showing subtle traces of dark veins in her forehead.",
     "scope": {
      "kind": "figure",
      "manufacturer": "hasbro",
      "product_line": "marvel-legends",
      "year": 2017,
      "character_canonical": "hela",
      "character_variant": null,
      "condition": null
     }
    },
    {
     "quote_id": "c_q3",
     "source_id": "c_s1",
     "text": "The eyes use the halftone printing we've been seeing and it looks good, as do the lips.",
     "scope": {
      "kind": "figure",
      "manufacturer": "hasbro",
      "product_line": "marvel-legends",
      "year": 2017,
      "character_canonical": "hela",
      "character_variant": null,
      "condition": null
     }
    },
    {
     "quote_id": "c_q4",
     "source_id": "c_s1",
     "text": "The black and emerald coloring is pretty tight, and you also get some painted flesh-tones on her exposed shoulders and her fingers.",
     "scope": {
      "kind": "figure",
      "manufacturer": "hasbro",
      "product_line": "marvel-legends",
      "year": 2017,
      "character_canonical": "hela",
      "character_variant": null,
      "condition": null
     }
    },
    {
     "quote_id": "c_q5",
     "source_id": "c_s1",
     "text": "Hela comes with on extra accessory, and that's her sword.",
     "scope": {
      "kind": "figure",
      "manufacturer": "hasbro",
      "product_line": "marvel-legends",
      "year": 2017,
      "character_canonical": "hela",
      "character_variant": null,
      "condition": null
     }
    },
    {
     "quote_id": "c_q6",
     "source_id": "c_s2",
     "text": "ball jointed neck, ball jointed shoulders, swivel-hinged elbows, swivel-hinged wrists, ball jointed chest, ball jointed hips with a decent range of motion, swivel thighs, double-hinged knees, and swivel-hinged ankles",
     "scope": {
      "kind": "figure",
      "manufacturer": "hasbro",
      "product_line": "marvel-legends",
      "year": 2017,
      "character_canonical": "hela",
      "character_variant": null,
      "condition": null
     }
    },
    {
     "quote_id": "c_q7",
     "source_id": "c_s2",
     "text": "The Cate Blanchett head is masterfully done and is truly beautiful. The hair is sculpted with sharp edges and uses a hard plastic.",
     "scope": {
      "kind": "figure",
      "manufacturer": "hasbro",
      "product_line": "marvel-legends",
      "year": 2017,
      "character_canonical": "hela",
      "character_variant": null,
      "condition": null
     }
    },
    {
     "quote_id": "c_q8",
     "source_id": "c_s2",
     "text": "Her face paint is flawless and even has faint viens just above her eyes.",
     "scope": {
      "kind": "figure",
      "manufacturer": "hasbro",
      "product_line": "marvel-legends",
      "year": 2017,
      "character_canonical": "hela",
      "character_variant": null,
      "condition": null
     }
    },
    {
     "quote_id": "c_q9",
     "source_id": "c_s2",
     "text": "Her costume is painted in a flat black with the chest plate and various line work highlighting her outfit in a dark metallic green paint.",
     "scope": {
      "kind": "figure",
      "manufacturer": "hasbro",
      "product_line": "marvel-legends",
      "year": 2017,
      "character_canonical": "hela",
      "character_variant": null,
      "condition": null
     }
    },
    {
     "quote_id": "c_q10",
     "source_id": "c_s2",
     "text": "Hela comes with a solid black sword with a lot of detail sculpted into it and an alternate head.",
     "scope": {
      "kind": "figure",
      "manufacturer": "hasbro",
      "product_line": "marvel-legends",
      "year": 2017,
      "character_canonical": "hela",
      "character_variant": null,
